2026-10-20T08:27:24Z ASSUMPTION (C5/C6): model fitted with base-R glm(binomial, logit) with raw polynomial terms x + I(x^2), since Equation 2 has no random effect and lme4 cannot fit a plain GLM. Wald z p-values from summary.glm. Height class not included (Eq. 2 does not contain it).
